title: "Still doing a double take"
date: "2026-09-03"
form: "note"
concepts: ["seeing", "photography", "perception"]
status: "published"
sample: true
---

The first look tells me what something is. The second look makes that answer less certain.

I keep thinking that photography begins there: not in noticing something beautiful, but in finding that an ordinary thing has not quite finished being ordinary.

Today it was the reflection of a window in another window. Nothing happened. I looked again.
